---
const trustItems = [
  '5,000+ corredores activos',
  '100% gratuito',
  'Todos los niveles',
];
---

<section class="relative h-[520px] w-full overflow-hidden md:h-[680px]">
  <!-- Background Image -->
  <img
    src="/images/newHero.jpeg"
    alt="Corredores en la ciudad"
    class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover "
  />

  <!-- Dark Overlay -->
  <div class="hero-overlay absolute inset-0"></div>

  <!-- Content -->
  <div
    class="relative z-10 flex h-full flex-col justify-center gap-5 px-5 pt-20 md:gap-6 md:px-[120px] md:pt-[120px]"
    data-reveal-group
    data-reveal-stagger="0.1"
  >
    <span class="block h-1 w-14 rounded-sm bg-accent md:w-20" data-reveal="left"></span>

    <h1 class="max-w-[900px] font-heading text-[36px] font-extrabold italic leading-[0.95] tracking-[-1px] text-white md:text-[70px] md:tracking-[-2px]" data-reveal>
      NO SOLO SOMOS<br />CORREDORES, SOMOS<br /> UN MOVIMIENTO.
    </h1>

    <p class="max-w-[600px] font-body text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-200 md:text-lg" data-reveal>
Para hacer algo grande no necesitas grandes escenarios, basta con unos tenis, amigos y las ganas de ser mejores. Las calles dejaron de ser solo calles, ahora se convirtieron en escenarios e historias.
    </p>

    <!-- CTA Row -->
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:gap-5" data-reveal>
      <button
        type="button"
        data-open-modal="register-modal"
        data-auth-guest-only
        class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 rounded bg-accent px-8 py-4 transition-opacity hover:opacity-90 md:px-12 md:py-[18px]"
      >
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-dark-950">
          <path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7" />
        </svg>
        <span class="font-heading text-sm font-bold tracking-[2px] text-dark-950 md:text-base">
          ÚNETE AL CLUB — ES GRATIS
        </span>
      </button>
      <a
        href="#rutas"
        class="flex items-center justify-center rounded border border-accent/25 px-8 py-4 transition-colors hover:border-accent/50 md:px-12 md:py-[18px]"
      >
        <span class="font-body text-sm font-semibold tracking-[2px] text-accent">
          VER RUTAS
        </span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Trust Line -->
    <div class="hidden items-center gap-6 sm:flex" data-reveal>
      {
        trustItems.map((item, i) => (
          <>
            {i > 0 && <span class="sr-only">·</span>}
            <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-accent" />
            <span class="font-body text-[13px] font-medium text-gray-200">
              {item}
            </span>
          </>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero-overlay {
    background:
      linear-gradient(
        to right,
        #0a0a0af0 0%,
        #0a0a0ab3 42%,
        #0a0a0a4d 75%,
        #0a0a0a1a 100%
      ),
      linear-gradient(
        to bottom,
        #0a0a0a80 0%,
        #0a0a0a00 30%,
        #0a0a0a00 65%,
        #0a0a0acc 100%
      );
  }
</style>
